{"step":1,"title":"配对拿 token（本设备 = android-device-1）","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/pair","auth":"none","json":{"code":"$pairingCode","device_id":"android-device-1","device_name":"Pixel 7","platform":"android","app_version":"1.0.0"}}},"expect":{"status":200,"capture":{"token":"$.token"}}}
{"step":2,"title":"空库快照：没有会话、没有下一页；watermark 是主机 op 日志的水位","do":{"http":{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/sync/snapshot","auth":"device"}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"sessions":[],"questions":[],"session_images":[],"has_more":false,"next_offset":null},"json_regex":{"watermark":"^[0-9]+$"},"capture":{"watermark0":"$.watermark"}}}
{"step":3,"title":"推一条**声称由主机产生**的 op（device_id = 主机）→ 静默跳过：既不算 applied 也不算 rejected","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/sync/ops","auth":"device","json":{"ops":[{"op_id":"op-forged-host","device_id":"server-device-1","lamport":999999,"entity":"question","entity_id":"q-forged","op_type":"upsert","fields_json":{"stem":"伪造","answer_text":"X","created_at":1,"updated_at":1,"updated_by":"server-device-1"}}]}}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"applied":0,"rejected":0}}}
{"step":4,"title":"推一条 device_id 与调用者不符的 op（冒充别的设备）→ rejected=1（不落地）","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/sync/ops","auth":"device","json":{"ops":[{"op_id":"op-impersonate","device_id":"android-device-9","lamport":999998,"entity":"question","entity_id":"q-impersonated","op_type":"upsert","fields_json":{"stem":"冒充","answer_text":"Y","created_at":1,"updated_at":1,"updated_by":"android-device-9"}}]}}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"applied":0,"rejected":1}}}
{"step":5,"title":"推本机新建「会话 + 题目」两条 op（快照的 questions 只带**本页会话**下的题目，所以会话行必须先存在）→ applied=2","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/sync/ops","auth":"device","json":{"ops":[{"op_id":"op-s1-create","device_id":"android-device-1","lamport":9,"entity":"session","entity_id":"s-sync-1","op_type":"upsert","fields_json":{"image_hash":"h-sync-1","source_device":"android-device-1","status":"done","question_count":1,"created_at":1000,"updated_at":1000,"updated_by":"android-device-1"}},{"op_id":"op-q1-create","device_id":"android-device-1","lamport":10,"entity":"question","entity_id":"q-sync-1","op_type":"upsert","fields_json":{"session_id":"s-sync-1","ordinal":0,"stem":"同步测试题","type":"blank","answer_text":"A","created_at":1000,"updated_at":1000,"updated_by":"android-device-1"}}]}}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"applied":2,"rejected":0}}}
{"step":6,"title":"快照里能看到这条题目，answer_text = A","do":{"http":{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/sync/snapshot","auth":"device"}},"expect":{"status":200,"json_contains":{"questions":[{"question_id":"q-sync-1","answer_text":"A"}]}}}
{"step":7,"title":"同一字段再来一条更高 lamport 的 op（同一个设备）→ LWW 取新值 B","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/sync/ops","auth":"device","json":{"ops":[{"op_id":"op-q1-upd","device_id":"android-device-1","lamport":11,"entity":"question","entity_id":"q-sync-1","op_type":"upsert","fields_json":{"answer_text":"B","updated_at":2000}}]}}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"applied":1,"rejected":0}}}
{"step":8,"title":"answer_text 已经是 B","do":{"http":{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/sync/snapshot","auth":"device"}},"expect":{"status":200,"json_contains":{"questions":[{"question_id":"q-sync-1","answer_text":"B"}]}}}
{"step":9,"title":"来一条**更低** lamport 的 op 改同一字段 → 被 LWW 挡住，仍是 B","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/sync/ops","auth":"device","json":{"ops":[{"op_id":"op-q1-stale","device_id":"android-device-1","lamport":9,"entity":"question","entity_id":"q-sync-1","op_type":"upsert","fields_json":{"answer_text":"旧值","updated_at":3000}}]}}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"applied":1,"rejected":0}}}
{"step":10,"title":"LWW 按 (lamport, device_id) 判定：低 lamport 的旧值不生效","do":{"http":{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/sync/snapshot","auth":"device"}},"expect":{"status":200,"json_contains":{"questions":[{"question_id":"q-sync-1","answer_text":"B"}]}}}
{"step":11,"title":"再配一台设备 android-device-2（op 只能以自己的 device_id 推）","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/pair","auth":"none","json":{"code":"$pairingCode","device_id":"android-device-2","device_name":"Mi 11","platform":"android","app_version":"1.0.0"}}},"expect":{"status":200,"capture":{"token2":"$.token"}}}
{"step":12,"title":"同 lamport（11）不同设备：android-device-2 > android-device-1 → 取 C","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/sync/ops","auth":"device:token2","json":{"ops":[{"op_id":"op-q1-d2","device_id":"android-device-2","lamport":11,"entity":"question","entity_id":"q-sync-1","op_type":"upsert","fields_json":{"answer_text":"C","updated_at":4000,"updated_by":"android-device-2"}}]}}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"applied":1,"rejected":0}}}
{"step":13,"title":"answer_text 已经是 C（同 lamport 时 device_id 字典序大的赢）","do":{"http":{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/sync/snapshot","auth":"device"}},"expect":{"status":200,"json_contains":{"questions":[{"question_id":"q-sync-1","answer_text":"C"}]}}}
{"step":14,"title":"同一条 op（op_id 相同）再投一次 → 按 op_id 幂等：applied=0","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/sync/ops","auth":"device:token2","json":{"ops":[{"op_id":"op-q1-d2","device_id":"android-device-2","lamport":11,"entity":"question","entity_id":"q-sync-1","op_type":"upsert","fields_json":{"answer_text":"D","updated_at":5000,"updated_by":"android-device-2"}}]}}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"applied":0,"rejected":0}}}
{"step":15,"title":"重复投递不改值：还是 C","do":{"http":{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/sync/snapshot","auth":"device"}},"expect":{"status":200,"json_contains":{"questions":[{"question_id":"q-sync-1","answer_text":"C"}]}}}
{"step":16,"title":"墓碑：高 lamport 的 delete op","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/sync/ops","auth":"device","json":{"ops":[{"op_id":"op-q1-del","device_id":"android-device-1","lamport":20,"entity":"question","entity_id":"q-sync-1","op_type":"delete","fields_json":{"deleted_at":6000,"updated_at":6000}}]}}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"applied":1,"rejected":0}}}
{"step":17,"title":"软删除的题目不再出现在快照的 questions 里（快照只给活行）","do":{"http":{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/sync/snapshot","auth":"device"}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"questions":[]}}}
{"step":18,"title":"拉取本机从 0 起的 op：只返回该设备自己的 op（lamport 升序）并给出游标","do":{"http":{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/sync/ops?from_device=android-device-1&since_lamport=0","auth":"device"}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"has_more":false},"json_regex":{"next_cursor":"^[0-9]+$"}}}
{"step":19,"title":"用游标再拉一次：没有新 op → ops 为空、next_cursor 为 null","do":{"http":{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/sync/ops?from_device=android-device-1&since_lamport=20","auth":"device"}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"ops":[],"has_more":false,"next_cursor":null}}}
{"step":20,"title":"拉取缺 from_device → 400 invalid_request","do":{"http":{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/sync/ops?since_lamport=0","auth":"device"}},"expect":{"status":400,"json":{"code":"invalid_request"}}}
{"step":21,"title":"上传第一张图（用来做两个会话，验证快照分页）","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/images","auth":"device","multipart":{"field":"file","bytes":2048,"filename":"p1.jpg"}}},"expect":{"status":200,"capture":{"h1":"$.image_hash"}}}
{"step":22,"title":"上传第二张图","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/images","auth":"device","multipart":{"field":"file","bytes":3072,"filename":"p2.jpg"}}},"expect":{"status":200,"capture":{"h2":"$.image_hash"}}}
{"step":23,"title":"主机已新建并选中合集（任务必须落在合集里）","do":{"seed":{"collection":{"id":"c-sync","name":"同步用合集"},"active_collection":"c-sync"}}}
{"step":24,"title":"建第一个识别任务","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/tasks","auth":"device","json":{"task_id":"t-sync-1","image_hash":"$h1","source_device":"android-device-1"}}},"expect":{"status":202,"capture":{"s1":"$.session_id"}}}
{"step":25,"title":"建第二个识别任务","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/tasks","auth":"device","json":{"task_id":"t-sync-2","image_hash":"$h2","source_device":"android-device-1"}}},"expect":{"status":202,"capture":{"s2":"$.session_id"}}}
{"step":26,"title":"等第一个任务完成","do":{"poll":{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/tasks/t-sync-1","auth":"device","until":{"status":"done"},"max_ms":20000,"interval_ms":100}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"status":"done"}}}
{"step":27,"title":"等第二个任务完成","do":{"poll":{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/tasks/t-sync-2","auth":"device","until":{"status":"done"},"max_ms":20000,"interval_ms":100}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"status":"done"}}}
{"step":28,"title":"快照分页：limit=1 → 只给 1 条会话、has_more=true、next_offset=1","do":{"http":{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/sync/snapshot?limit=1","auth":"device"}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"has_more":true,"next_offset":1}}}
{"step":29,"title":"最后一页：offset=2（库里有 3 条活会话：op 推的那条 + 两次真实识别）→ has_more=false、next_offset=null","do":{"http":{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/sync/snapshot?limit=1&offset=2","auth":"device"}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"has_more":false,"next_offset":null}}}
{"step":30,"title":"两页合起来正好是刚才两次识别的会话（快照按 created_at 升序）","do":{"http":{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/sync/snapshot?limit=10","auth":"device"}},"expect":{"status":200,"json":{"has_more":false},"json_contains":{"sessions":[{"session_id":"$s1"},{"session_id":"$s2"}]}}}
{"step":31,"title":"给「没有页序行」的会话重新生成 → 409 invalid_request（原图不在主机上；原来会抛异常变成非协议 500）","do":{"http":{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/sessions/s-sync-1/reanalyze","auth":"device"}},"expect":{"status":409,"json":{"code":"invalid_request"}}}
{"step":32,"title":"快照里的图片是元数据，且**不得**带主机的本地文件路径（本地专属列不进同步载荷）","do":{"http":{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/sync/snapshot","auth":"device"}},"expect":{"status":200,"json_regex":{"images[0].hash":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$"},"json_absent":["$.images[0].local_path"]}}
